<mark name="beat1_ask"/>
An engineer asks OutcomeOps a question grounded in their own architecture.
<break time="1200ms"/>
<mark name="beat2_search"/>
Workspaces narrow the scope. <say-as interpret-as="characters">MCP</say-as> servers attach. The knowledge base searches six repos.
<break time="800ms"/>
<mark name="beat3_grounded"/>
The answer comes back grounded — citing A D R zero zero one for error handling, A D R zero zero six for Python patterns. Pydantic validation. Structured audit events. Typed responses.
<break time="400ms"/>
