Then the actual handler — written to your patterns, not generic Lambda boilerplate.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="beat5_sources"/>
Every claim links back to source. Six results from your code-maps and A D Rs, reranked by Cohere. About four-tenths of a cent for the round trip.
